# Moonshot / Kimi Open Platform's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-moonshot-setting-api-key = A Moonshot / Kimi Open Platform API key, from https://platform.moonshot.ai/console/api-keys (International) or https://platform.moonshot.cn/console/api-keys (China mainland). Use a key issued for the region set below.
usage-moonshot-setting-region = Which platform issued the key: "international" (the default, api.moonshot.ai, balances in USD) or "china" (api.moonshot.cn, balances in CNY).

## The report: the prepaid balance and its voucher and cash parts. Amounts
## (such as $46.59) stay as figures.

usage-moonshot-available = Available
usage-moonshot-balance = Balance
usage-moonshot-voucher = Voucher
usage-moonshot-cash = Cash
# How far the cash balance is below zero.
usage-moonshot-in-deficit = In deficit
